# Word of Command (CR 723.2, 601.2f-h, 733.1): "the player plays that card if able". Bone Splinters' additional cost, sacrificing a
# creature, can't be paid by Bot2, who has none: no choice could complete the cast, so Bot2 is not able to cast it and it
# stays in Bot2's hand - nothing is asked of it, and the game goes on (Bot1's Memnite untouched).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Memnite
Word of Command
Swamp x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Bone Splinters
Plains x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Word of Command.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Bone Splinters)
? Bot2.Hand.Bone Splinters.Colors = Black
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Hand.Bone Splinters.Colors = Black
Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Tapped = false
